  "term": "short-term psychodynamic psychotherapy",
  "definition": "Short-term psychodynamic psychotherapy (STPP) is a manualized form of psychodynamic psychotherapy designed to be delivered over a limited period. In this packet, it is described as a psychotherapy approach studied in routine practice for social anxiety disorder.",
